  "details": "# Issue:\n\nI can't 100% confirm this as I'm unable to actually test Group Queues with this (they are really annoying to test alone), but as I also didn't see anything about this in the change log, I decided to make a canny about it.\n\nRight now I would assume that there is no real integration between preloading a World and Joining the Group Queue for it. Which will probably be quite annoying, as the time you spent waiting could also be used to download the World.\n\n# Suggestion:  \n\nJoining a Group Queue should automatically preload the world so that once you can Join you can also just skip the loading progress.",
